s":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"HKK6VX8Kb7OM2uUnYBsSWw","review_id":"WCNQx8J2C6av4ac7S9ZbmA","date":"2016-09-13T04:28:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9287574887275696,"text_excerpt":"The visit today wasn't bad at all. I haven't been here in years but much hasn't changed. The parking is a hit or miss so you may or may not get a decent spot but if you're a cardio lover you'll enjoy the further spaces. The store itself is very well kept, clean, and the aisles are well managed. The produce section had a wide variety of items to choose from but some of the prepacked veggies looked a bit out of shape. Their produce prices we're really reasonable with Winn-Dixie rewards. The meat and poultry were priced reasonably. There were a few items near expiration but they were clearly marked and additionally discounted. The other sections were well stocked and up to par. I enjoyed nav..."},{"business_id":"HKK6VX8Kb7OM2uUnYBsSWw","review_id":"f2PY736iI0pJ6xzNPNM2nQ","date":"2014-07-12T18:21:47","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9182192087173462,"text_excerpt":"Not bad if you have a rewards card. The sales are decent and the staff has always been courteous and kind to us. Produce is better than walmart although not as good as some other places. We stop here at twice a week so I think the staff knows us by now ;)"},{"business_id":"HKK6VX8Kb7OM2uUnYBsSWw","review_id":"PZ5cSV1545OUyzDAHGxgVg","date":"2014-06-27T06:20:45","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9145662188529968,"text_excerpt":"Store has been doing better under the new management of Mark. The interior of the store has been renovated which was long overdue. They also have an array of new cashiers who bring more life into the store, the change is dramatic. Winn-Dixie can be an excellent place to shop if you know when certain things are on sale, and the fuel perks program is untouchable. Who else loves cheap gas? THIS CHICK SURE DOES!!"}],"visual":[]},"notebook_case":null}
